   524	## 6. Exploratory hypothesis (labelled exploratory; directional only)
   525	"At the 4410 operating point, at least one of G / H has lower qualified
   526	latency (headline-eligible, tier PASS, SDR PASS) than the fastest of C1 / C2
   527	/ C3 with verified graph replay (§3)." B (manual capture) is reported
   528	separately and is not a comparator here. G and H are bundles, so this ranking
   529	attributes nothing causally to "fusion" or "concurrency" on its own. No
   530	numeric ratio is registered (no derivation exists yet; §4 and the session-2
   531	kernel counts are the inputs one would need). If a required comparator is
   532	unavailable, the restricted comparison is reported as such.
