    29	    launches-per-pass must equal wrapper multiplicity or the row is flagged;
    30	    kern_sum aggregate cross-check recorded (f23).
    31	  * stack membership: interior SDPA window + kernel-NAME reuse for the L0
    32	    prologue / L5 epilogue. The dedup assumption is CHECKED post-hoc: an
    33	    L0-vs-interior-layers A/B asymmetry raises a flag (f22).
    34	  * producer map is position-aware (latest write BEFORE the consumer);
    35	    head-split and head-merge verdicts are tri-state (true/false/unresolved)
    36	    with unknown ancestry never counting as a view (f26); COPY-class launches
    37	    adjacent to SDPA in the trace are counted (silent-failure signal).
    38	  * the CSV is the ledger; every JSON total is summed from it. status='ok'
    39	    ONLY when no flag was raised — downstream acceptance requires that.
